Short:    Download Counter V1.0 for FAME
Uploader: siegel@trsi.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Author:   siegel@trsi.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Type:     comm/misc
Version:  1.0
Requires: FAME V1.29+, Kickstart V3.x

mEGA-dLC is a Download Counter Utility for FAME. It supports
multiply conference addings with different counter styles for
every conference. It's extremly fast and take only a minimum
waiting time for the user (Background processing).
